config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: The steps of a job behind Harden-Runner
  accDescr: Harden-Runner blocks every host that the job doesn't list. A job that starts containers keeps sudo, and takes GitHub's DNS experiment away. Every job then makes sure that the agent of Harden-Runner blocks, and stops when it doesn't, so that it can run again. It asks its hosts every 3 seconds, for two minutes at most, until Harden-Runner lets them through, and runs its steps. A job without sudo and Docker ends only after Harden-Runner has removed Docker, also after a failure.
  BLOCK["Harden-Runner blocks every host<br/>that the job doesn't list"] --> SUDO{"Does the job start containers,<br/>so that it keeps sudo?"}
  SUDO -- "yes" --> LOOKUPS["Let Harden-Runner see the DNS lookups:<br/>GitHub's DNS experiment goes"]
  LOOKUPS --> SURE
  SUDO -- "no" --> SURE{"Make sure that Harden-Runner blocks:<br/>does its agent run?"}
  SURE -- "no, as in an outage of GitHub" --> STOP(["The job stops,<br/>so that it can run again"])
  SURE -- "yes" --> WAIT["Wait until Harden-Runner lets the hosts through:<br/>each host every 3 s, two minutes at most"]
  WAIT --> STEPS["The steps of the job"]
  STEPS -- "with sudo" --> END(["The job ends"])
  STEPS -- "without sudo and Docker,<br/>also after a failure" --> DOCKER["Wait until Harden-Runner<br/>has removed Docker"]
  DOCKER --> END
  classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  class BLOCK,LOOKUPS,SURE,WAIT,DOCKER bot
  class END done
